  "title": "Logistic Properties of the Americas Announces First Quarter 2026 Earnings Results",
  "summary": "Logistic Properties of the Americas Announces First Quarter 2026 Earnings Results Growth Momentum Continues, as Revenues Grow 21.6% YoY and NOI increases 28.6% SAN JOSÉ, Costa Rica, May 13, 2026 – Logistic Properties of the Americas (NYSE American: LPA) (together with its subsidiaries, “LPA” or “the Company”), announced today its unaudited consolidated financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026 (“first quarter 2026” or “1Q26”). The financial results are expressed in U.S. dollars […]",
